Feature: IC-894 - NEHPA HVAC Sale Within 60-Day Window Remains Matched

  Scenario: IC-894-TC-001 - NEHPA HVAC Sale Within 60-Day Window Remains Matched
    Given a Contractor user is logged in
      And a residential heat pump sale exists in MA, NH, RI, or CT
      And the sale is matched to "NEHPA HVAC"
      And the sale invoice date is less than 60 days before today
    When the user opens the qualifying residential heat pump sale
    Then the sale remains matched to "NEHPA HVAC"
      And the current program assignment is "NEHPA HVAC"
